+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/periods/generate-quarters — make the four calendar quarters of a year. Body
+# {"year":"2026"}: periods 2026-Q1 to 2026-Q4, from Jan-Mar to Oct-Dec; each is made as the period form adds it
+# (a quarter whose name is taken or whose days overlap a period is left out).
+# A year that is not yyyy is refused with 400 and nothing is stored. Responds {"made":n}.
